{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2394","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2394/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2394/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/issues/2394/events","html_url":"https://github.com/less/less.js/issues/2394","id":54436777,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1NDQzNjc3Nw==","number":2394,"title":"!important keyword with parametric mixin","user":{"login":"Craigy-","id":1394335,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTQzMzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1394335?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-","html_url":"https://github.com/Craigy-","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Craigy-/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2103265,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTAzMjY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"e10c02","default":true,"description":null},{"id":9603697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NjAzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/less/less.js/labels/low%20priority","name":"low priority","color":"02e10c","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2015-01-15T11:03:28Z","updated_at":"2015-01-26T22:13:17Z","closed_at":"2015-01-26T22:13:17Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Mixin:\n\n``` css\n.size(@width: auto; @height: auto) {\n  .set-width(@size) when (ispercentage(@size)) {\n    width: @size;\n  }\n  .set-width(@size) when (isnumber(@size)) and not (ispercentage(@size)) {\n    width: unit(@size, px);\n  }\n  .set-width(@size) when not (isnumber(@size)) and not (ispercentage(@size)) {\n    width: auto;\n  }\n  .set-height(@size) when (ispercentage(@size)) {\n    height: @size;\n  }\n  .set-height(@size) when (isnumber(@size)) and not (ispercentage(@size)) {\n    height: unit(@size, px);\n  }\n  .set-height(@size) when not (isnumber(@size)) and not (ispercentage(@size)) {\n    height: auto;\n  }\n\n  .set-width(@width);\n  .set-height(@height);\n}\n```\n\nIf I call it like: `.size(100%)`, CSS compiles as well.\nIf I call it like: `.size(100%) !important`, I see an error \"NameError: variable @size is undefined\".\n\nLess v1.7 compiles two calls, but v2.0 thrown an error. Can you help?\n","closed_by":{"login":"lukeapage","id":309321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTMyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/309321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage","html_url":"https://github.com/lukeapage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukeapage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/us